                            <div class="blog-content">
                                <p data-start="222" data-end="447" class="">The <strong data-start="226" data-end="275">Rajasthan Board of Secondary Education (RBSE)</strong> is expected to announce the <strong data-start="304" data-end="349">Class 10 and Class 12 results in May 2025</strong>. Students who appeared for the exams can check their results online through the official website.</p>
<hr data-start="449" data-end="452" class="">
<h3 data-start="454" data-end="497" class="">📅 <strong data-start="461" data-end="497">RBSE Result 2025: Expected Dates</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="498" data-end="629">
<li data-start="498" data-end="563" class="">
<p data-start="500" data-end="563" class=""><strong data-start="500" data-end="520">Class 12 Result:</strong> Likely between <strong data-start="536" data-end="563">May 20 and May 30, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="564" data-end="629" class="">
<p data-start="566" data-end="629" class=""><strong data-start="566" data-end="586">Class 10 Result:</strong> Expected from <strong data-start="601" data-end="629">June 10 to June 15, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="631" data-end="634" class="">
<h3 data-start="636" data-end="665" class="">📝 <strong data-start="643" data-end="665">RBSE Exam Overview</strong></h3>
