<li data-start="666" data-end="726" class="">
<p data-start="668" data-end="726" class=""><strong data-start="668" data-end="687">Class 12 Exams:</strong> Held from <strong data-start="698" data-end="726">March 6 to April 9, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="727" data-end="796" class="">
<p data-start="729" data-end="796" class=""><strong data-start="729" data-end="748">Class 10 Exams:</strong> Conducted between <strong data-start="767" data-end="796">March 6 and April 4, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="798" data-end="801" class="">
<h3 data-start="803" data-end="838" class="">🔔 <strong data-start="810" data-end="838">Latest Updates from RBSE</strong></h3>
