<p data-start="841" data-end="1012" class=""><strong data-start="841" data-end="888">Class 12 Business Studies Exam Rescheduled:</strong><br data-start="888" data-end="891">The paper held on March 23 was cancelled due to repetition of the 2024 paper. It will now be held on <strong data-start="994" data-end="1011">April 9, 2025</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1014" data-end="1220" class="">
<p data-start="1016" data-end="1053" class=""><strong data-start="1016" data-end="1051">Class 5 Exam Timetable Changed:</strong></p>
<ul data-start="1056" data-end="1220">
<li data-start="1056" data-end="1101" class="">
<p data-start="1058" data-end="1101" class=""><strong data-start="1058" data-end="1071">EVS Exam:</strong> Moved to <strong data-start="1081" data-end="1099">April 16, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1104" data-end="1166" class="">
<p data-start="1106" data-end="1166" class=""><strong data-start="1106" data-end="1130">Third Language Exam:</strong> Rescheduled to <strong data-start="1146" data-end="1164">April 17, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1169" data-end="1220" class="">
<p data-start="1171" data-end="1220" class="">Exams will run from <strong data-start="1191" data-end="1220">April 7 to April 17, 2025</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="1222" data-end="1399" class="">
<p data-start="1224" data-end="1324" class=""><strong data-start="1224" data-end="1249">Class 9 and 11 Exams:</strong><br data-start="1249" data-end="1252">Will be conducted from <strong data-start="1277" data-end="1304">April 24 to May 8, 2025</strong>, in two sessions:</p>
<ul data-start="1327" data-end="1399">
<li data-start="1327" data-end="1362" class="">
